@model string
@* Sign-in with a Microsoft (university) or Google account. Not connected yet: it needs the platform registered
   with Microsoft Entra ID and Google Cloud and a server-side sign-in (docs/auth-external-providers.md). Until
   then the buttons say «قريباً», and a press explains in the note below them that it is not available yet
   (landing.js); they never pretend to sign anyone in. The two marks are the providers' own sign-in marks, used
   only to name them (see docs/auth-external-providers.md, "The two logos"). Model: "login" or "register", to keep the ids of the two copies apart. *@
<div class="nl-auth-sso" role="group" aria-labelledby="nl-auth-sso-title-@Model">
<p class="nl-auth-divider" id="nl-auth-sso-title-@Model"><span>@(Model == "register" ? "أو أنشئ حسابك باستخدام" : "أو تابع باستخدام")</span></p>
<div class="nl-auth-sso-grid">
<button type="button" class="nl-auth-sso-btn" data-auth-provider="microsoft" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="nl-auth-sso-note-@Model"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 21 21"><rect x="1" y="1" width="9" height="9" fill="#f25022"></rect><rect x="11" y="1" width="9" height="9" fill="#7fba00"></rect><rect x="1" y="11" width="9" height="9" fill="#00a4ef"></rect><rect x="11" y="11" width="9" height="9" fill="#ffb900"></rect></svg><span>حساب Microsoft الجامعي</span><small class="nl-auth-soon">قريباً</small></button>
<button type="button" class="nl-auth-sso-btn" data-auth-provider="google" aria-disabled="true" aria-describedby="nl-auth-sso-note-@Model"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path fill="#ea4335" d="M24 9.5c3.5 0 6.6 1.2 9 3.5l6.7-6.7C35.6 2.4 30.2 0 24 0 14.6 0 6.6 5.4 2.6 13.3l7.8 6.1C12.3 13.6 17.6 9.5 24 9.5Z"></path><path fill="#4285f4" d="M46.5 24.5c0-1.6-.1-3.1-.4-4.5H24v9h12.7c-.6 2.9-2.2 5.4-4.7 7.1l7.6 5.9c4.4-4.1 6.9-10.1 6.9-17.5Z"></path><path fill="#fbbc05" d="M10.4 28.6A14.5 14.5 0 0 1 9.5 24c0-1.6.3-3.2.8-4.6l-7.8-6.1A24 24 0 0 0 0 24c0 3.9.9 7.5 2.6 10.7l7.8-6.1Z"></path><path fill="#34a853" d="M24 48c6.5 0 11.9-2.1 15.9-5.8l-7.6-5.9c-2.1 1.4-4.9 2.3-8.3 2.3-6.4 0-11.7-4.1-13.6-9.9l-7.8 6.1C6.6 42.6 14.6 48 24 48Z"></path></svg><span>حساب Google</span><small class="nl-auth-soon">قريباً</small></button>
</div>
<p class="nl-auth-sso-note" id="nl-auth-sso-note-@Model" role="status">الدخول بحساب الجامعة أو Google غير متاح بعد؛ يمكنك الدخول الآن بالبريد الإلكتروني أو بحساب تجريبي.</p>
</div>